User Experience & User Stories
Core Idea
A marketplace for buying and selling brand 2nd hand clothes and fashion items. The
app allows users to list, browse, and purchase items easily while offering secure
payments and delivery options tailored to the Lebanese market.
Target Audience
• Individuals looking to buy or sell second-hand fashion at affordable prices.
• Online shoppers interested in sustainable but good brand clothing options.
• Thrift shops looking to increase their sales.
• Small businesses that are looking to expand their online presence.
Key problems it solves
• No reliable only clothes marketplace in Lebanon.
• Convenient delivery options over Lebanon.
• Encourages Sustainable fashion.
• Increase awareness on 2nd hand clothing.
