Buyer requirements
• As a buyer, I want to create my own account using email, google, or Facebook
and put my own password so that I can sell or buy items.
• As a buyer, I want to browse items by word search, image search, categories,
filters, sort by options, so that I can quickly find what I’m looking for.
• As a buyer, I want to see recommended items based on my interests and previous
searches so that I can discover new fashion pieces.
• As a buyer, I want to view most trusted users so that I can know who to buy from
and get scammed.
• As a buyer, I want to save items to my favorites so that I can return to them later.
• As a buyer, I want to chat with sellers so that I can ask questions or request
pictures or a video.
• As a buyer, I want to make secure payments through the app so that I don’t have
to worry about scams.
• As a buyer, I want to track my order status so that I know when to expect my
delivery.
• As a buyer, I want to leave reviews and rate sellers so that I can help others make
informed decisions.
• As a buyer, I want a reward point system so that I can be appreciated with free
vouchers.
• As a buyer, I want to know more about the company and its policies.
