User Buyer Stories
• User Registration:
- As a new user, I want to register using my email and password so that I can
create an account and start buying or selling items.
- Acceptance criteria:
1. User can register using email and password
2. System validates email format
3. User receives a confirmation email after registration
4. Registration success redirects user to the homepage
• Item Browsing
- As a buyer, I want to browse items by word search, image search, categories,
filters, and sort-by options so that I can quickly find what I’m looking for.
1. Buyer can search items by keywords
2. Buyer can upload an image for search
3. Buyer can filter by categories, price range, condition, size, color, material, brand
4. Buyer can sort items by relevance, price, newest, location, trusted accounts,
shipping
5. Search results update instantly based on filter.
7
• Recommended Items
- As a buyer, I want to see recommended items based on my interests and
previous searches so that I can discover new fashion pieces.
1. System tracks buyer’s previous search history
2. System displays personalized product recommendations
3. Recommendations are refreshed based on browsing behavior
4. Buyer can view recommended items in a separate section
• Trusted Users
- As a buyer, I want to view most trusted users so that I can know who to buy from
and avoid getting scammed.
1. Users can see a “trusted” badge on seller profiles
2. System calculates trustworthiness based on ratings, reviews, and transaction
history
3. Buyers can filter listings to show only trusted users
• Save to Favorites
- As a buyer, I want to save items to my favorites so that I can return to them later.
1. Buyer can click a “save” icon to add items to favorites
2. Favorites list is accessible from the user profile
3. Buyer can remove items from favorites
• Chat with Sellers
- As a buyer, I want to chat with sellers so that I can ask questions or request
pictures or videos.
1. Buyer can send messages to sellers based on specific action buttons requests
2. System notifies the seller of a new message
3. Chat history is visible to both buyer and seller
4. Seller can send messages that include photos, video, or any text
8
• Secure Payments
- As a buyer, I want to make secure payments through the app so that I don’t have
to worry about scams.
1. Buyer can select payment method (Cash on delivery, credit card, Whish, Omt,
Bob Finance)
2. System encrypts payment details securely
3. Buyer receives a payment confirmation email
4. Payment transaction status is visible in the user profile
• Order Tracking
- As a buyer, I want to track my order status so that I know when to expect my
delivery.
1. Buyer can view the current order status (Order pending, Being picked up, In
warehouse, On the Way, Delivered)
2. System sends automatic updates on order status via email and app notifications
• Leave Reviews & Rate Sellers
- As a buyer, I want to leave reviews and rate sellers so that I can help others make
informed decisions.
1. Buyer can rate a seller on a scale of 1-5 stars
2. Buyer can write a detailed review of the transaction that can also include
pictures or videos
3. Seller’s profile displays the average rating and reviews
• Reward Points
- As a buyer, I want a reward point system so that I can be appreciated with free
vouchers.
1. Buyer earns points with every purchase (1$=1pt)
2. Points can be redeemed for vouchers or discounts
3. System tracks the buyer’s points and redemption history
4. Buyers receive notifications when points are applicable for redemption
9
• Company Information
- As a buyer, I want to know more about the company and its policies.
1. Buyer can access a who we are, how we work, job opportunities, customer
support, how to, privacy policies, terms and conditions, and our social media
sections.
2. Dedicated sections that include separate pages with details about the company
and providing help for new users
User Seller Stories
• User Registration:
- As a new user, I want to register using my email and password so that I can
create an account and selling items.
- Acceptance criteria:
1. User can register using email and password
2. System validates email format
3. User receives a confirmation email after registration
4. Registration success redirects user to the homepage
• Upload Item Details
- As a seller, I want to upload photos and details of my items easily so that I can list
them quickly.
1. Seller can upload multiple images and videos
2. Seller has to enter item details (name, description, category, price, condition,
etc.)
3. Seller has to enter item location (existing location or new location)
4. System displays a preview of the listing before posting
• Item Listing Management
- As a seller, I want to be able to give my items and not worry about listing or
talking to customers so that I can focus on other tasks.
1. Seller can opt-in for a “full-service” listing management option
2. Admin handles the communication and listing process for the seller
3. Seller receives notifications when their item sells or needs attention
10
• Price Flexibility
- As a seller, I want to set my own prices and update them later so that I can adjust
to market demand
1. Seller can set an initial price for each item
2. Seller can update the price at any time
3. System reflects price updates instantly on the listing
• Seller Notifications
- As a seller, I want to receive notifications when someone messages or buys my
item so that I can respond promptly.
1. Seller receives notifications for messages from buyers
2. Seller receives notifications for new orders and offers
3. Seller can adjust notification preferences in the settings
• Discounts on Listings
- As a seller, I want to offer discounts on my listings so that I can attract more
buyers.
1. Seller can apply a discount to individual items or a group of items
2. System calculates the discounted price and displays it on the listing
3. Buyer sees the original price and the discounted price on the item
• Bump Listings
- As a seller, I want to bump my item so that I can attract more customers.
1. Seller can pay a small fee to bump their listing to the top of the search results
2. Item is moved to the top for a limited period of time
3. System notifies the seller when the bump expires
• Bump Wardrobe
- As a seller, I want to bump my entire wardrobe so that I can attract more
customers.
1. Seller can bump all their active listings in one action
2. All items in the wardrobe are moved to the top for a limited time
3. Seller is notified when the bump expires
