- As a seller, I want to receive my payments securely.
1. Seller can choose secure payment methods (Cash, Whish)
2. System ensures payments are processed and securely transferred
3. Seller receives a payment confirmation and transaction history
• Duplicate Listing
- As a seller, I want to duplicate a listing so that I can quickly add products and not
