- As a delivery boy, I want to change the delivery status so that customers know
when to expect me.
1. Delivery boy can update the status to "on the way," "delivered," etc.
2. The customer receives real-time notifications when the delivery status changes
3. Status updates are visible to both the buyer and admin
12
