- As a delivery boy, I want access to the customer's phone number so that I can
contact them in case of issues during delivery.
1. Delivery boy can view the phone number associated with the delivery
2. Delivery boy can call or message the customer from his personal number
3. The phone number is kept private and only accessible by delivery personnel
