User Admin Stories
• Manage User Accounts
- As an admin, I want to manage user accounts so that I can verify identities and
remove fake accounts.
- Admin can view a list of all user accounts
- Admin can verify user details and documents (e.g., ID, email)
- Admin can deactivate or remove fake or fraudulent accounts
- Admin can send notifications to users for account verification requests
• Track Transactions
- As an admin, I want to track all transactions so that I can detect fraud or payment
issues.
1. Admin can view a complete transaction history (buyer, seller, amount, status)
2. Admin can filter transactions by status (pending, completed, failed)
3. Admin can flag suspicious transactions for review
4. System provides real-time transaction data
13
• Manage listings
- As an admin, I want to quality assure all listings before getting listed
1. Admin can view and review all new listings submitted by sellers
2. Admin can approve or reject listings based on quality guidelines (e.g., image
quality, product description, pricing, etc.)
3. Admin can request sellers to modify their listings if they do not meet the
platform's standards
4. Admin receives a notification when a listing is awaiting approval
5. Approved listings are published on the platform, while rejected ones are
returned to sellers with feedback
6. Admin can flag or remove listings that violate platform policies (e.g., prohibited
items, inappropriate content)
• Delivery Options
- As an admin, I want to decide whether product will be delivered by company’s
delivery boys or by an outside delivery system
1. Admin can select the appropriate delivery method based on delivery location
2. The system automatically notifies the buyer about the selected delivery method
3. The chosen delivery method is reflected in the order details and tracking system
• Send Notifications
- As an admin, I want to send push notifications and emails so that I can engage
users.
1. Admin can create and send push notifications to buyers, sellers, or both
2. Admin can send personalized email notifications
3. Admin can segment users based on categories (active buyers, old buyers,
buyers with 500+ points, new sellers, old sellers, trusted sellers)
4. System allows scheduling of notifications
• Generate Reports
- As an admin, I want to generate reports on user activity and sales so that I can
analyze business performance
1. Admin can generate reports on sales, revenue, and user engagement
14
2. Admin can export reports in various formats (CSV, PDF)
3. Admin can filter reports by date range, product category, and location
4. Reports provide detailed insights for business decisions
• Handle Refunds and Disputes
- As an admin, I want to handle refund and dispute requests so that I can resolve
issues between buyers and sellers.
1. Admin can view and manage refund requests and disputes
2. Admin can approve or reject refunds based on the system’s policies
3. Admin can mediate between buyers and sellers for dispute resolution
4. Admin can log actions taken for each dispute
• Reply to Customer Support Messages
- As an admin, I want to reply to customer support messages so that I can resolve
issues with either buyers or sellers.
1. Admin can view all incoming customer support requests
2. Admin can reply to messages from both buyers and sellers
3. Admin can track the status of each support request
